description:
Construction of a single-storey rear and side
extension linking existing garage and outbuilding to the main house, extension
to the existing outbuilding and raising of height to include a green roof;
raising roof height of the existing garage;&nbsp; new rear patio and raising of fence height; installation of three front roof lights; and changes to exterior
fenestration of main building, garage and outbuilding in relation to doors,
windows and brick detailing.&nbsp;
